---

<Layout title="Mariner Finance Waldorf, Md & Richmond Va. | ATECT Architecture" description="Mariner Finance Waldorf, Md & Richmond Va. — comprehensive construction documents, interior fit-out design, ADA compliance, project management and permitting services by ATECT Architecture.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Commercial Projects</div>
    <h1>Mariner Finance Waldorf, Md &amp; Richmond Va.</h1>
    <p>Comprehensive construction documents and interior fit-out services for two Mariner Finance locations.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="section project-intro">
    <div class="project-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Mariner Finance</div>
      <h2>Interior Fit-Out &amp; Construction Documents</h2>
      <p>We delivered a comprehensive array of construction documents for the interior fit-out of two distinct locations, situated in Waldorf, Maryland, and Richmond, Virginia. Our team ensured that both spaces adhered strictly to current building regulations as well as the latest ADA (Americans with Disabilities Act) requirements.</p>
      <p>The design process focused on creating functional and aesthetically pleasing office environments, thoughtfully incorporating a breakroom to promote employee relaxation and collaboration. We also introduced a new ADA-compliant bathroom that features a dedicated mop sink area, ensuring cleanliness and sanitation. Additionally, we included the installation of a new Hi-lo drinking fountain, making hydration accessible to all.</p>
      <p>To facilitate a smooth process, we provided detailed project management services and expedited the permitting process for our client, ensuring compliance and efficiency every step of the way.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="scope-card">
      <div class="eyebrow">Scope of Work</div>
      <ul>
        <li>Complete interior fit-out construction documents</li>
        <li>Waldorf, Maryland and Richmond, Virginia locations</li>
        <li>Building-code and ADA compliance</li>
        <li>Functional office and breakroom planning</li>
        <li>ADA-compliant bathroom with mop sink area</li>
        <li>New Hi-lo drinking fountain</li>
        <li>Project management and coordination</li>
        <li>Expedited permitting support</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section gallery-section">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div class="eyebrow">Project Gallery</div>
      <h2>Mariner Finance</h2>
      <p>Project imagery and construction-document materials from the original ATECT Architecture commercial portfolio.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="commercial-gallery">
      {images.map((image, index) => (
        <figure class:list={{ "gallery-feature": index === 0 }}>
          <img src={image.src} alt={image.alt} loading={index === 0 ? "eager" : "lazy"} />
        </figure>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section alt project-cta">
    <div>
      <div class="eyebrow">Commercial Design Services</div>
      <h2>Need construction documents for your next project?</h2>
      <p>Let's discuss your commercial space, fit-out, permitting and documentation needs.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button dark" href="/contact">Contact ATECT Architecture</a>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  .project-intro{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.55fr) minmax(280px,.75fr);gap:clamp(40px,7vw,100px);align-items:start}
  .project-copy h2,.section-heading h2,.project-cta h2{font:600 clamp(34px,4.5vw,58px)/1.05 Manrope;margin:0 0 24px;letter-spacing:-.03em}
  .project-copy p{color:#555;line-height:1.8;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 22px}
  .scope-card{background:#f3f1ec;padding:34px;border-top:4px solid #111}
  .scope-card ul{margin:20px 0 0;padding:0;list-style:none}
  .scope-card li{padding:13px 0;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(17,17,17,.14);line-height:1.5;color:#333}
  .scope-card li:last-child{border-bottom:0}
  .gallery-section{padding-top:20px}
  .section-heading{max-width:760px;margin-bottom:42px}
  .section-heading p{color:#666;line-height:1.7;font-size:17px}
  .commercial-gallery{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}
  .commercial-gallery figure{margin:0;overflow:hidden;background:#f2f2f2;aspect-ratio:4/3}
  .commercial-gallery figure.gallery-feature{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:span 2;aspect-ratio:auto;min-height:100%}
  .commercial-gallery img{display:block;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transition:transform .5s ease}
  .commercial-gallery figure:hover img{transform:scale(1.025)}
  .project-cta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px}
  .project-cta h2{margin-bottom:14px}
  .project-cta p{color:#555;line-height:1.7;max-width:650px;margin:0}
  @media(max-width:900px){
    .project-intro{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .commercial-gallery{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}
    .commercial-gallery figure.gallery-feature{grid-column:span 2;grid-row:auto;aspect-ratio:16/10}
    .project-cta{flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start}
  }
  @media(max-width:600px){
    .commercial-gallery{grid-template-columns:1fr}
    .commercial-gallery figure.gallery-feature{grid-column:span 1}
    .commercial-gallery figure{aspect-ratio:4/3}
    .scope-card{padding:26px}
  }
</style>
